    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man cuman feormæþ III niht an his agenum hame, cepeman oþþe oðerne þe sio ofer mearce cumin, ⁊ hine þonne his mete fede, ⁊ he þonne ænignum mæn yfel gedo, se man þane oðerne æt rihte gebrenge oþþe riht forewyrce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person provides for a visitor for 3 nights in his own home, a merchant or other who has come across the border, and [the host] there feeds him [the guest] his food, and he [the guest] then does harm to any person, that man [the host] should bring the other to justice or do [what is required by] justice for him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man cuman feormæþ III niht an his agenum hame (cepeman oþþe oðerne þe sio ofer mearce cuman) ⁊ hine þonne his mete fede, ⁊ he þonne ænignum mæn yfel gedo, se man þane oðerne æt rihte gebrenge oþþe riht forewyrce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
